msgstr "Fuinneog"

msgid "Open preferences"
msgstr "Oscail sainroghanna"

msgid "Show shortcuts"
msgstr "Taispeáin aicearraí"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Sainroghanna"

msgid "Startup Defaults"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe tosaithe"

msgid "Experimental Features"
msgstr "Gnéithe turgnamhacha"

msgid "Default station"
msgstr "Stáisiún réamhshocraithe"

msgid "J-POP"
msgstr "J-POP"

msgid "K-POP"
msgstr "K-POP"

msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Uathsheinm"

msgid "Start playing automatically on launch"
msgstr "Tosaigh ag seinm go huathoibríoch ag am tosaithe"

msgid "Enable pause and resume"
msgstr "Cumasaigh sos agus atosú"

msgid "Use pause and resume for the main playback button"
msgstr "Úsáid sos agus atosú don phríomhchnaipe athsheinm"

msgid "Discord Rich Presence"
msgstr "Discord Rich Presence"

msgid "Enable Discord Rich Presence at runtime"
msgstr "Cumasaigh Discord Rich Presence le linn rite"

msgid "It is time to ditch other radios. Stream and metadata provided by LISTEN.moe."
msgstr "Tá sé in am deireadh a chur le raidiónna eile. Sruth agus meiteashonraí arna soláthar ag LISTEN.moe."

msgid "J-POP and K-POP radio"
msgstr "Raidió J-POP agus K-POP"

msgid "Listen to J-POP and K-POP"
msgstr "Éist le J-POP agus K-POP"

msgid "Pause and resume the live stream"
msgstr "Cuir an sruth beo ar sos agus atosaigh é"

msgid "Animated sound bars that react to the music"
msgstr "Barraí fuaime beoite a imoibríonn don cheol"

msgid "Dynamic colors based on the current album or artist cover"
msgstr "Dathanna dinimiciúla bunaithe ar chlúdach an albaim nó ar íomhá an ealaíontóra reatha"

msgid "No ads"
msgstr "Gan fógraí"

msgid "Initial release."
msgstr "Eisiúint tosaigh."

msgid "When connected and there is no album or artist image"
msgstr "Nuair atá ceangal ann agus níl íomhá albaim ná ealaíontóra ar fáil"

msgid "Colored window when connected"
msgstr "Fuinneog daite nuair atá sí ceangailte"

msgid "AI translation (GPT-5.2); reviewed by nobody"
msgstr "Machine translation (Google Translate, edited with Codex); not human-reviewed"

msgid "This release focuses on visuals and localization."
msgstr "Díríonn an leagan seo ar an gcuma agus ar an logánú."

msgid "Fine-tuned dark/light mode detection so light colors are no longer mistaken for dark ones."
msgstr "Aimsiú mód dorcha/éadrom mionchoigeartaithe ionas nach gcearrtar dathanna solais as dathanna dorcha a thuilleadh."

msgid "Polished translations and improved how they are applied."
msgstr "Aistriúcháin snasta agus feabhas ar an gcaoi a gcuirtear i bhfeidhm iad."

msgid "Removed gaps between sound bars."
msgstr "Baineadh bearnaí idir barraí fuaime."

msgid "Streaming logic now better handles connection issues and stream changes."
msgstr "Is fearr a láimhseálann an loighic sruthaithe saincheisteanna nasctha agus athruithe srutha anois."

msgid "Clarified the application description."
msgstr "Soiléiriodh cur síos ar an bhfeidhmchlár."

msgid "Translated image captions"
msgstr "Fotheidil íomhánna aistrithe"

msgid "Updated screenshots to use a more reasonable window size"
msgstr "Gabhálacha scáileáin nuashonraithe le méid fuinneoige níos oiriúnaí"

msgid "Updated application icon"
msgstr "Deilbhín feidhmchláir nuashonraithe"

msgid "Display the application icon in media controls."
msgstr "Taispeáin deilbhín an fheidhmchláir i rialuithe meán."

msgid "Optional Discord activity sharing"
msgstr "Comhroinnt gníomhaíochta Discord Roghnach"

msgid "Added Discord activity sharing."
msgstr "Cuireadh comhroinnt gníomhaíochta Discord leis."

msgid "Reconnect to Discord instead of disabling this feature."
msgstr "Athcheangal le Discord in ionad an ghné seo a dhíchumasú."

msgid "Added flags to control pause behavior, autoplay, or disable Discord integration."
msgstr "Bratacha curtha leis chun iompar sos a rialú, uath-imirt, nó comhtháthú Discord a dhíchumasú."

msgid "Fixed an issue where paused playback resumed during a network disruption."
msgstr "Réitíodh fadhb inar atosaíodh athsheinm a bhí ar sos le linn briseadh líonra."

msgid "Added preferences and keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr "Cuireadh sainroghanna agus aicearraí méarchláir leis."

msgid "Changed pause, resume, and station switching behavior."
msgstr "Athraíodh sos, atosú, agus iompar aistrithe stáisiúin."

msgid "Added startup options for pause/resume or stop behavior, with play/stop now the default."
msgstr "Cuireadh roghanna tosaithe leis le haghaidh sos/atosú nó stop, le seinm/stop mar réamhshocrú anois."

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Seiceáil le haghaidh nuashonruithe"

msgid "Cancel update"
msgstr "Cealaigh nuashonrú"

msgid "Couldn't check for updates"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir nuashonruithe a sheiceáil"

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Bain triail eile as ar ball."

msgid "Already up to date"
msgstr "Cheana féin suas chun dáta"

msgid "You have the latest version of Listen Moe."
msgstr "Tá an leagan is déanaí de Listen Moe agat."

msgid "The release metadata is missing a valid SHA-256 digest."
msgstr "Tá achoimre bhailí SHA-256 in easnamh ar na meiteashonraí eisithe."

msgid "Couldn't download the update"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an nuashonrú a íoslódáil"

msgid "Update canceled"
msgstr "Nuashonrú cealaithe"

msgid "The update was canceled."
msgstr "Cuireadh an nuashonrú ar ceal."

msgid "The update check was canceled."
msgstr "Cuireadh an tseiceáil nuashonraithe ar ceal."

msgid "The downloaded installer will not be installed."
msgstr "Ní bheidh an suiteálaí íoslódáilte suiteáilte."

msgid "Installing update"
msgstr "Nuashonrú a shuiteáil"

msgid "Listen Moe will close."
msgstr "Dúnfaidh Listen Moe."

msgid "Couldn't install the update"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an nuashonrú a shuiteáil"

msgid "Checking for updates"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil le haghaidh nuashonruithe"

msgid "Downloading update"
msgstr "An nuashonrú á íoslódáil"

msgid "Update ready"
msgstr "Nuashonrú réidh"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Leagan"

msgid "Downloaded"
msgstr "Íosluchtaithe"

msgid "Looking for a newer Windows installer on GitHub Releases."
msgstr "Ag lorg suiteálaí Windows níos nuaí ar GitHub Releases."

msgid "A newer Windows release is available."
msgstr "Tá leagan níos nuaí den aip do Windows ar fáil."

msgid "The installer is ready to run."
msgstr "Tá an suiteálaí réidh le rith."

msgid "Couldn't start the installer."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an suiteálaí a thosú."

msgid "Removed pause/resume from stable builds."
msgstr "Baineadh sos/atosú ó thógáil cobhsaí."

msgid "Separate experimental features from stable features."
msgstr "Gnéithe turgnamhacha a scaradh ó ghnéithe cobhsaí."

msgid "Volume control added."
msgstr "Cuireadh rialú airde fuaime leis."

msgid "Karaoke"
msgstr "Karaoke"

msgid "Show karaoke"
msgstr "Taispeáin karaoke"

msgid "Finding lyrics…"
msgstr "Liricí á lorg…"

msgid "Just a moment"
msgstr "Nóiméad amháin"

msgid "No synchronized lyrics"
msgstr "Gan liricí sioncronaithe"

msgid "This song can still be your tiny concert."
msgstr "Is féidir an t-amhrán seo a bheith fós mar do cheolchoirm bheag."

msgid "Couldn't load lyrics"
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir na liricí a lódáil"

msgid "Try again in a moment."
msgstr "Bain triail eile as i gceann nóiméad."

msgid "Lyrics by LRCLIB"
msgstr "Liricí ó LRCLIB"

msgid "Added lyrics."
msgstr "Liricí curtha leis."

msgid "Added a song progress bar."
msgstr "Cuireadh barra dul chun cinn amhráin leis."

msgid "Long artist and song names scroll smoothly."
msgstr "Scrollaíonn ainmneacha fada ealaíontóirí agus amhrán go réidh."

msgid "Hover over the title to see the full text."
msgstr "Cuir an pointeoir os cionn an teidil chun an téacs iomlán a fheiceáil."

msgid "Scrolling text and background animations respect Reduce Motion."
msgstr "Cloíonn téacs scrollaithe agus beochan cúlra leis an socrú chun gluaiseacht a laghdú."
